#: data/io.github.bruno_srio.Lumen.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Lumen finds Yeelight lights on the local network and lets you turn them on or off, change brightness, set a color or a white temperature, save colors, group lights, run an effect, and set a sleep timer. It is a native GNOME application and does not need a Yeelight account or an internet connection."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.bruno_srio.Lumen.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "LAN Control has to be enabled for each light in the Yeelight mobile app. Names you choose are stored on this computer and stay attached to the light even if its IP address changes."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.bruno_srio.Lumen.metainfo.xml.in:24
msgid "Yeelight is a trademark of its owner. Lumen is an independent project and is not affiliated with Yeelight."
msgstr ""

